&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td data-col-size="md" data-end="1586" data-start="1545"&gt;Condi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o l&amp;oacute;gica que ativa esse arquivo&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td data-col-size="xl" data-end="1731" data-start="1586"&gt;Diz: &amp;#x201c;s&amp;oacute; inclua este arquivo se a feature &lt;em data-end="1645" data-start="1630"&gt;Commissioning&lt;/em&gt; estiver selecionada no VDM&amp;#x201d;. &amp;Eacute; o v&amp;iacute;nculo direto entre &lt;em data-end="1715" data-start="1700"&gt;feature model&lt;/em&gt; e &lt;em data-end="1728" data-start="1718"&gt;artefato&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/td&gt;
